# 2025-11-20 21:39:06.228724
+FIX BUILD ERROR in MoodPal v2 immediately:
+
+From output logs: TypeScript error in ./components/MoodPalCanvas.tsx:124:13
+"Element implicitly has an 'any' type because expression of type 'string' can't be used to index type '{ en: {...}, fr: {...}, ... }'."
+
+Cause: translations[userLang] where userLang is string, but object has no index signature.
+
+Quick fixes in MoodPalCanvas.tsx:
+1. Change line 124 to: const langKey = userLang as keyof typeof translations; setLang(translations[langKey] || translations.en);
+   (Or add index signature to translations: { [key: string]: typeof translations.en; } & typeof translations)
+
+2. Ensure all translations access use safe indexing (e.g., translations[langKey as keyof typeof translations]?.placeholder || translations.en.placeholder)
+
+3. If Node crypto warning appears, add to package.json scripts/build: "NODE_OPTIONS=--openssl-legacy-provider next build"
+
+Keep ALL v2 features: full chibi drawing (eyes/body/colors/animations), streaks/badges, calendar, multilingual (10 langs), 3 buttons (download/cast/gift).
+
+Rebuild and deploy fixed version now. No other changes.

