# 2025-11-20 21:56:19.906762
+EMERGENCY FIX MoodPal v2 build + drawing bug:
+
+Current app shows broken chibi (static triangle hair, blue square body, pink eyes) that doesn't change with mood, and displays before input. Multilingual works (French OK), streaks/buttons visible but incomplete.
+
+Root cause: Canvas drawing code in MoodPalCanvas.tsx is incomplete/buggy. No mood parsing for dynamic traits, no RNG for variants, no full body/animations.
+
+COMPLETE REWRITE of canvas JS only (keep all UI: streaks, calendar "Jour 1" green dot, multilingual auto EN/FR/ES/PT/DE/JA/KO/ZH/TR/AR, 3 buttons with simu cast/gift):
+
+In generateChibi() function:
+1. Parse mood text (lowerCase): 
+   - If includes "love/amour/amore" → heart eyes (pink pupils), blush cheeks, soft pink neon palette
+   - "chaos/kaos" → swirl eyes (yellow spirals), messy hair spikes, orange sparks animation
+   - "sad/triste/melancholy" → teary eyes (blue droops), downturn mouth, purple aura fade
+   - "happy/joyeux/heureux" → star eyes (gold sparkles), big smile, yellow glow
+   - Default: round eyes (neutral gray), simple mouth, earth tones
+   - Add random RNG: Math.random() for eye size (+/-20%), accessory (crown/wings/halo based on streak: 3d=crown,7d=wings,30d=halo)
+
+2. Draw FULL chibi on 300x300 canvas (transparent BG):
+   - Round head (ctx.arc 100,100,r=80, skin #FFDAB9)
+   - Big eyes (2 circles r=20 at 70/130 y=80, fill by mood color, pupils by shape)
+   - Mouth (arc or line by mood)
+   - Hair (triangle or spikes by mood)
+   - Tiny body (rect 100,180,w=60,h=80, color shift neon)
+   - Streak badges: draw crown/wings/halo on head if streak >=3/7/30
+   - Eye-blink: CSS @keyframes every 3s (scale y 0.1 on eyes)
+
+3. Download PNG: canvas.toDataURL('image/png') → link.download
+4. Cast simu: alert("Day [streak] – Feeling [mood] 🧚 #MoodPal")
+5. Gift: prompt("Wallet address?") → alert("Sent to [addr]!")
+
+Fix TS error from logs: In translations access, use const langKey = (userLang as keyof typeof translations) || 'en'; setLang(translations[langKey]);
+
+If crypto warning: Add to build script "NODE_OPTIONS=--openssl-legacy-provider next build"
+
+Use vanilla JS in canvas (no TS strict, fallback any if needed). Test with "flottant et amoureux" → heart chibi pink.
+
+Rebuild/deploy fixed v2 now. No other changes.

